{"nodeId":"kp:21300","contents":[],"requirements":{"knowledgeRequirement":{"value":"教材用直角坐标点(a,b)表示复数a＋bi，建立平面点与复数的一一对应；横轴为实轴，纵轴为虚轴。","originalWording":"如图9-2-1，在平面上建立直角坐标系，以坐标为$(a,b)$的点$Z$表示复数$z=a+bi$，就可在平面上点的集合与复数集合之间建立一个一一对应．这样用来表示复数的平面叫做复平面（complex plane）．\n在复平面上，$x$轴上的点具有$(a,0)$形式的坐标，从而对应的都是实数，所以把$x$轴叫做实轴（real axis）；同理，$y$轴上的点（除坐标原点外）都对应纯虚数，所以把$y$轴叫做虚轴（imaginary axis）．坐标原点表示实数$0$．","scope":"材料支持范围：虚轴除原点外对应纯虚数，原点对应实数零；复平面定义与轴的例外完整。","status":"material_supported","sourceId":"TB-B2","sourceEdition":"既有已接收教材/教案材料；不是新增2025独立细点条文","evidence":[{"id":"ev:book-2:L119:TB:plane:b0","sourceId":"TB-B2","sourceSha256":"492092a8c87c004406f396db214fc2355757d1ec5407919ca372b5e5e04df485","locator":{"headingPath":["9.2 复数的几何意义","教材复平面定义"],"part":"pdf","pdfPage":157,"renderedPage":157,"printedPage":150,"paragraphIndex":null,"tableIndex":null,"rowIndex":null,"cellIndex":null,"equationObjectId":null},"quote":"这样用来表示复数的平面叫做","wordingChecked":true,"mathChecked":true,"mathSourceAsset":null,"rawMetadataRetainedInOriginalJson":true,"resource":{"url":"r80/assets/e500d8783ad68f7cc892b022.png","bytes":210657,"sha256":"e500d8783ad68f7cc892b02245027b0062d0ba368194971aa0bcb7ee85aa0c7c","sourceId":"TB-B2","kind":"same_original_textbook_pdf_page","localOrigin":"/Users/yichen.zhang/vibe coding/codex/projects/数学教育平台/knowledge-network/review/textbook-content/page-evidence/b2-ch89-draft/ch9/TB-B2-pdf157.png","expectedHashMatched":null,"requestedPath":"increments/l123-v1/evidence/TB-B2-L119/page-157.png"},"sourceTitle":"必修第二册","sourceStatus":"original_source_identity_preserved"},{"id":"ev:book-2:L119:TB:axes:b0","sourceId":"TB-B2","sourceSha256":"492092a8c87c004406f396db214fc2355757d1ec5407919ca372b5e5e04df485","locator":{"headingPath":["9.2 复数的几何意义","教材实轴虚轴与原点"],"part":"pdf","pdfPage":157,"renderedPage":157,"printedPage":150,"paragraphIndex":null,"tableIndex":null,"rowIndex":null,"cellIndex":null,"equationObjectId":null},"quote":"坐标原点表示实数","wordingChecked":true,"mathChecked":true,"mathSourceAsset":n